prosody/plugins/mod_token_affiliation.lua
  Copia, sem alteracao de codigo, de resources/prosody-plugins/mod_token_affiliation.lua do Jitsi Meet
  (originalmente importado de https://github.com/jitsi-contrib/prosody-plugins, token_affiliation), sob a
